---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { privacyIsDraft } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice | Falls City Dev Studio"
  description="Draft privacy notice for the Falls City Dev Studio website and project inquiry form."
  noindex={privacyIsDraft}
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="A plain-English privacy notice."
    copy="This page explains what information this website is designed to collect and why. It must be reviewed and completed by the site owner before launch."
  />

  <section class="section section--bright">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="legal-draft"><strong>Owner review required:</strong> This is a working draft, not finalized legal advice. Before publishing, the owner must verify provider names, retention practices, contact instructions, and any legal obligations that apply to the business.</p>

      <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
      <p>When the project inquiry form is configured and available, you can submit your name, email address, business name if you choose, the type of service you are interested in, and details about your project. Falls City Dev Studio uses this information to review and respond to your inquiry and to take follow-up steps you request.</p>
      <p>Please do not include passwords, payment card details, Social Security numbers, health information, or other sensitive information in the project details field.</p>

      <h2>Form processing and spam protection</h2>
      <p>The intended inquiry setup uses Cloudflare Turnstile to help prevent automated spam and Resend to deliver the inquiry by email. When you use the configured form, information and technical request data may be processed by those providers according to their own terms and privacy policies.</p>
      <p>The website code does not intentionally store inquiry submissions in a website database. The final retention practices for delivered email and provider logs must be confirmed and documented by the owner before launch.</p>

      <h2>Technical information</h2>
      <p>Hosting and security providers may process standard request information such as IP address, browser type, requested pages, and timestamps to deliver and protect the website. No analytics service is enabled in the initial website implementation.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>The initial website implementation does not set advertising or analytics cookies. Cloudflare Turnstile may use necessary browser storage or similar technology when the inquiry form is enabled. This section must be updated if the site's providers or measurement tools change.</p>

      <h2>How information is used</h2>
      <p>Inquiry information is used to review and answer website project inquiries, to communicate about a project or service you asked about, and to protect the form and the website from abuse so they keep running securely.</p>
      <p>The studio should not sell personal information collected through this website. Any service providers used should receive only the information needed to perform their function.</p>

      <h2>Retention and your choices</h2>
      <p>Inquiry information should be kept only as long as reasonably needed for communication, business records, security, and applicable obligations. The owner must define and verify the actual retention period before this notice is treated as final.</p>
      <p>You may ask what information you have submitted or request that the studio correct or delete it, subject to applicable recordkeeping requirements. A verified privacy contact method must be added here before launch.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
      <p>This notice should be reviewed when the form, hosting, analytics, or other data-processing practices change. The published version should include a verified effective date after owner review.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
